# Copy to frontend/.env.local (git-ignored) and set the keys you have.
#
# The settings every machine needs are already in frontend/.env, which is
# committed — this file is only for what is yours. Vite reads .env.local in
# every mode, so the dev server, `npm run build` and the Docker image build all
# use the same keys.
#
# Both keys are optional, and both are public by design: anything named VITE_*
# is compiled into the JavaScript every visitor downloads. Never put a real
# secret here. Don't set VITE_API_BASE_URL in this file either — a blank value
# here would override frontend/.env's `/` and the app refuses to start.

# Digitransit's geocoder: place search that knows HSL's own stops and platforms.
# Without it, search falls back to Photon — addresses still work, stop
# suggestions don't. Free at https://portal-api.digitransit.fi
VITE_DIGITRANSIT_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY=

# CARTO basemap tiles. Without it the map still loads, on an anonymous tier
# that sometimes serves an "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark. Free at https://carto.com
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=
